ng today I just I'm  absolutely flabbergasted that that this  kind of thing  goes on I hope that it reflects poorly  on on Justin Trudeau anyway sorry to  wander off my usual language learning  subject but i'm just still just can't  get over the fact that he charges  $20,000 to go to a school to talk to  educators anyway thanks for listening  and if somebody wants to pay me twenty  thousand dollars to go and talk to us  cool i will tell them to take that  twenty thousand dollars and contribute  it towards education or do something  else with it instead of giving it to me  and i should continue Justin Trudeau has  an annual income from his speeches well  in excess of 200 thousand dollars not to  count his inheritance from his father he  doesn't need the money he doesn't need  and he has his income as a member of  parliament it's just appalling and I  don't know how rich Al Gore is and  there's many more like him I think we  need to wisen up to some of the scams  that are going on here I expect a great  avalanche of nasty comments thanks for  listening bye for now
 

